{
  "$comment": "Story 60.14: every store listing image Maktaba's apps need, per store, with the store's own source. Read by make.mjs (the mockups), tests/store-gallery.test.mjs and, after the style is approved, by the composer that writes the full set (60.14 part 2). Sizes are pixels, width x height. 'style' is how the composer draws the asset: captioned (a caption band over the app's screen, no device frame), plain (the capture itself, unaltered), tile (the icon and the name in both scripts), feature (the feature graphic), art (brand art, no text), icon (the app icon, resized). 'langs' is per-language (en and ar sets) or single (one set for every language, the store allows no other). A number marked 'unconfirmed' comes from an older or unofficial copy of the store's guide, as its note says.",
